{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 2026-05-08 - 五月热门主线题材梳理\n\n资料脑图｜按原文结构生成",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "1",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 风险提示\n- 13秒视频信息量极少，仅做题材方向参考。\n- \"题材\"本质上是短期市场情绪，不构成投资逻辑。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -460,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "2",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "不含代表标的，不应自行补脑添加个股。",
      "x": -79,
      "y": -665,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "2",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "不构成投资建议。",
      "x": 79,
      "y": -665,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "2",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 视频信息\n- 作者：主升学长\n- 时长：13秒（极短视频，可能只有字幕快闪）",
      "x": 624,
      "y": -230,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "3",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "发布：2026-05-08",
      "x": 889,
      "y": -372,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "3",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "互动：65赞 / 1评 / 8分享（低热度）",
      "x": 968,
      "y": -293,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "3",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 视频声称\n",
      "x": 624,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 提取状态\n- 完整转写：80-raw-原始资料/Cubox/股票/extracted/7637442424410754342_trans…\n- 视频仅13秒，只有题材名称快闪，没有逻辑、标的和数据。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "只能作为市场情绪线索，不能作为研究结论。",
      "x": 79,
      "y": 665,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 题材清单（来源声称）\n- 排名 / 题材 / 当前可用信息\n- 1 / 商业航天 / 仅题材名，无逻辑",
      "x": -624,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "6",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2 / <span style=\"color:#d6a100\">机器人</span> / 仅题材名，无逻辑",
      "x": -889,
      "y": 372,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "6",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3 / 算力 / 仅题材名，无逻辑",
      "x": -968,
      "y": 293,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "6",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n14",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 待研究问题\n- 13秒视频内容非常有限，是否有配套图文或系列更新？\n- 提到的题材是否有机构研报支撑？",
      "x": -624,
      "y": -230,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "7",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n15",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "哪些题材有实际业绩支撑vs纯题材炒作？",
      "x": -968,
      "y": -293,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "7",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n16",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "这四条是否与5月真实涨幅、成交额、龙虎榜或机构研报一致？",
      "x": -889,
      "y": -372,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "7",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    }
